{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2550"},"reason":"Body extended in all three languages (new passage and table row) to carry the new fact f28010 (Ganges); a few connecting phrases adjusted so the page still reads as one.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Environmental_personhood"},{"url":"https://www.downtoearth.org.in/amp/story/water/sc-stays-uk-hc-order-declaring-ganga-yamuna-living-entities-58245"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",773],["+"," Only days later, on 20 March 2017, the High Court of the Indian state of Uttarakhand cited the Whanganui example when it declared the Ganges and its main tributary, the Yamuna, living entities with the rights of a legal person, in the hope of protecting India's most sacred and most polluted rivers. The Supreme Court of India stayed that ruling on 7 July 2017, after the state government objected that nobody could say who would pay damages when the rivers flooded."],["=",134],["+","\n| India | Ganges and Yamuna declared legal persons (ruling stayed) | 2017 |"]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",711],["+"," Nur wenige Tage später, am 20. März 2017, berief sich das Obergericht des indischen Bundesstaats Uttarakhand auf das Beispiel des Whanganui, als es den Ganges und seinen wichtigsten Nebenfluss, die Yamuna, zu lebenden Wesen mit den Rechten einer juristischen Person erklärte – in der Hoffnung, die heiligsten und zugleich am stärksten verschmutzten Flüsse Indiens zu schützen. Der Oberste Gerichtshof Indiens setzte das Urteil am 7. Juli 2017 aus, nachdem die Landesregierung eingewandt hatte, niemand könne sagen, wer bei Überschwemmungen für die Schäden aufkommen müsse."],["=",126],["+","\n| Indien | Ganges und Yamuna als juristische Personen (Urteil ausgesetzt) | 2017 |"]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",675],["+"," Всего через несколько дней, 20 марта 2017 года, Высокий суд индийского штата Уттаракханд, сославшись на пример Уонгануи, объявил Ганг и его главный приток Ямуну живыми существами с правами юридического лица — в надежде защитить самые священные и самые загрязнённые реки Индии. Верховный суд Индии приостановил это решение 7 июля 2017 года после того, как правительство штата возразило, что никто не может сказать, кто будет возмещать ущерб при наводнениях."],["=",124],["+","\n| Индия | Ганг и Ямуна — юридические лица (решение приостановлено) | 2017 |"]]}],"hash":"ab3d9c55be6d"},
{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28010"},"reason":"New researched question integrated into the article body: The Ganges ruling of 2017 is the most widely reported river-personhood case after the Whanganui and was missing.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Environmental_personhood"},{"url":"https://www.downtoearth.org.in/amp/story/water/sc-stays-uk-hc-order-declaring-ganga-yamuna-living-entities-58245"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Ganges"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Ganges"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Ганг"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2477,6],"de":[2643,6],"ru":[2547,4]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"2017-03-20","end":null,"precision":"day","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"Uttarakhand High Court declares the Ganges and Yamuna legal persons","labelDe":"Obergericht von Uttarakhand erklärt Ganges und Yamuna zu juristischen Personen","labelRu":"Высокий суд Уттаракханда объявляет Ганг и Ямуну юридическими лицами"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Environmental_personhood","title":"Environmental personhood – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"80eb794906fc"},
{"seq":41,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27010"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact f28010 (answer: Ganges).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"Which Indian river, together with its main tributary the Yamuna, did the High Court of Uttarakhand declare a living legal person in March 2017?"},{"field":"de","new":"Welchen indischen Fluss erklärte das Obergericht von Uttarakhand im März 2017 zusammen mit seinem wichtigsten Nebenfluss, der Yamuna, zu einer lebenden juristischen Person?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Какую индийскую реку Высокий суд штата Уттаракханд в марте 2017 года вместе с её главным притоком Ямуной объявил живым юридическим лицом?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28010"}],"hash":"54bce89b9a4c"},
